==Icelandic==

===Verb===
'''sýna''' (+{{dat}}/{{accusative}}) ([[sýndi]] - [[sýnt]])

# to [[show]]
#: ''Að '''sýna''' manninum blaðið.''
#:: To '''show''' the paper to the man.
# (of art) to [[exhibit]]
#: ''Hvenær '''sýnirðu''' verkin þín?''
#:: When are you going to '''show''' your work?
# (of a play) to give a [[performance]]

====Derived terms====
* [[sýnast]] ([[reflexive verb]])
* [[sýna ljóslega]] (to [[manifest]])
* [[sýna fram á]] (to [[prove]])
* [[sýna af sér kæti]] (to act [[cheerful]])
* [[sýna í tvo heimana]] (to [[hold a knife to one's throat]])
* [[sýna hvar Davíð keypti ölið]]

